CEYGO App Overview

Purpose
CeyGo is a digital companion that simplifies metro and bus travel across Sri Lanka. It centralizes trip planning, smart card management, and fare payments so riders can move confidently without waiting in queues or carrying cash.

Key Features
• Step-by-step onboarding introduces the app’s route discovery, live tracking, and navigation benefits, setting riders up for success from the first launch.
• A personalized home hub shows saved NFC travel cards, balance snapshots, quick links to core services, and the latest trips in one glance.
• Tap to explore metro membership plans with rich descriptions, pricing perks, and recommended use cases that match different lifestyles.
• Wallet top-ups are effortless thanks to quick amount suggestions, a smooth keypad, and modern payment options.
• Fare Explorer compares routes between stations, highlights comfort classes, and clarifies service inclusions before riders commit to a journey.
• My Tickets, History, and Notifications keep upcoming rides and past activity organized, helping travellers stay in control of their movement.
• A polished profile area neatly groups account settings, support options, and personalization tools for long-term riders.

Target Audience
• Daily commuters who rely on metro and bus services to travel between work, school, and home.
• Families managing multiple NFC travel cards and keeping tabs on shared balances and weekend journeys.
• Leisure travellers eager to discover new destinations, compare fares, and benefit from seasonal plans and promotions.

CeyGo delivers a modern, reliable travel companion for anyone looking to navigate Sri Lanka’s public transport network with confidence.
